From 6aec4700c9c3ae01eda0037c4f17387e04f1c1a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 15:02:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] clk: nexell: add S5P6818 clock driver (PLLs + clk-gen)

Registers the core PLLs (pll0..3 + sys bus clocks) and peripheral clock
generators. 'nexell,clk-critical' keeps a gate enabled for IP whose consumer
never calls clk_prepare_enable (e.g. GbE TX clock). pll_rate/bus_rate guard an
unregistered parent; recalc_rate derives PCLK-gated rates (e.g. I2C). Validated.

Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
